WEBVTT

00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:01.646
Dr. Bunnell is an expert in speech synthesis,

00:03:01.646 --> 00:03:03.679
and what he'd been doing is building

00:03:03.679 --> 00:03:05.560
personalized voices for people

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.657
by putting together

00:03:07.657 --> 00:03:09.807
pre-recorded samples of their voice

00:03:09.807 --> 00:03:12.686
and reconstructing a voice for them.

00:03:12.686 --> 00:03:14.398
These are people who had lost their voice

00:03:14.398 --> 00:03:16.309
later in life.

00:03:16.309 --> 00:03:17.703
We didn't have the luxury

00:03:17.703 --> 00:03:19.477
of pre-recorded samples of speech

00:03:19.477 --> 00:03:21.769
for those born with speech disorder.

00:03:21.769 --> 00:03:24.306
But I thought, there had to be a way

00:03:24.306 --> 00:03:26.250
to reverse engineer a voice

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.541
from whatever little is left over.

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:31.255
So we decided to do exactly that.